# Commit text files with LF endings whatever the machine editing them.
# The server is Linux; CRLF sneaking into PHP or shell files causes real
# breakage (stray ^M in headers, shebangs that don't run).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mo binary
